# #5837, a5e2e2ef's S-a: the WAL shard's eviction of L's foreign-high entry folds every class
# attributed to L under the empty token into the eviction floor.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestEvictionDropsChainForward
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the eviction folds L's activations' and its orphan's and donor's forwards but not a forward chain's record, so a chain record below the eviction start leaves L's foreignHigh
PERTURBS: Evict
BOUNDS: MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithRestart = TRUE, WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithReforward = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ evFloor' = Max({evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \cup LeafAttributed})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the eviction does not fold ChainFwd.
    /\ evFloor' = Max({evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \cup (LeafAttributed \ {ChainFwd})})
--- END
